    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the cutest and most fearsome squad ever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/71d14108b2ddc1e99ccef5d258a12dba.poster.avif?t=1750987253\" width=560 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/71d14108b2ddc1e99ccef5d258a12dba.webm?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/71d14108b2ddc1e99ccef5d258a12dba.mp4?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Shard Squad</strong>, help a team of elemental creatures save their lands in a thrilling and chaotic adventure filled with monsters and projectiles leaping off your screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/ccac129a302364b51d99880e3e21b139.poster.avif?t=1750987253\" width=560 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/ccac129a302364b51d99880e3e21b139.webm?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/ccac129a302364b51d99880e3e21b139.mp4?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry\u2014great challenges come with great allies! The squad is ready to assist you, providing valuable items or even cooking up nutrients to power you up to defeat the toughest bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/41829b2307c0fdd7978efafd3b67fd5a.poster.avif?t=1750987253\" width=560 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/41829b2307c0fdd7978efafd3b67fd5a.webm?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/41829b2307c0fdd7978efafd3b67fd5a.mp4?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speaking of bosses, brace yourself for a wave of unique creatures constantly testing your skills. And if you manage to overcome them, an even greater calamity awaits at the end of each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/4d80d98aef7a1a20fac7ec70eda025a2.poster.avif?t=1750987253\" width=560 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/4d80d98aef7a1a20fac7ec70eda025a2.webm?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/4d80d98aef7a1a20fac7ec70eda025a2.mp4?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: no battle is fought alone! The squad always has each other's backs, and you get to choose who fights by your side, bringing the mechanics you need to overcome vicious hordes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/a32738c1de21589665e7d49e776fec15.poster.avif?t=1750987253\" width=560 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/a32738c1de21589665e7d49e776fec15.webm?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/a32738c1de21589665e7d49e776fec15.mp4?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hordes! Defeat bosses! Grow stronger! And in the end, unlock new members to expand your build options and secure victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/809d5f72cfe2608b849e93098c210de9.poster.avif?t=1750987253\" width=560 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/809d5f72cfe2608b849e93098c210de9.webm?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/809d5f72cfe2608b849e93098c210de9.mp4?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the cutest and most fearsome squad ever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/71d14108b2ddc1e99ccef5d258a12dba.poster.avif?t=1750987253\" width=560 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/71d14108b2ddc1e99ccef5d258a12dba.webm?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/71d14108b2ddc1e99ccef5d258a12dba.mp4?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Shard Squad</strong>, help a team of elemental creatures save their lands in a thrilling and chaotic adventure filled with monsters and projectiles leaping off your screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/ccac129a302364b51d99880e3e21b139.poster.avif?t=1750987253\" width=560 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/ccac129a302364b51d99880e3e21b139.webm?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363560/extras/ccac129a302364b51d99880e3e21b139.mp4?t=1750987253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry\u2014great challenges come with great allies! The squad is ready to assist you, providing valuable items or even cooking up nutrients to power you up to defeat the toughest bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img